│   ├── It should calculate withdrawal based on withdrawalWeight only for strategies in range
│   ├── It should skip strategies in range with zero withdrawalWeight (no share of allocation; no revert)
│   ├── It should respect maxWithdrawal limits for each strategy in range
│   ├── It should withdraw funds only from strategies in the specified range
│   ├── It should record lastStrategyWithdrawal for each strategy withdrawn from (starts the deposit cooldown)
