│   ├── It should emit FundsWithdrawnFromStrategy with net ETH received by controller (balance delta across withdraw())
│   ├── It should emit StrategyWithdrawFailed(strategy, reason) and continue when one strategy.withdraw() reverts
│   └── It should handle proportional withdrawal correctly within the range
