│   ├── It should include Controller balance in ETH
│   ├── It should include AMM free balance in ETH (excludes lockedForClaims)
│   ├── Given AMM holds locked claim ETH
│   │   └── It should exclude lockedForClaims from NAV (count only freeBalance)
│   ├── Given in-window priced ExitQueue batches
│   │   ├── It should deduct liabilityETH from liveRedemptionOffsets
│   │   └── It should not deduct unpriced queued EVE (still cancellable equity)
│   ├── Given a priced batch is past MAX_BATCH_PROCESSING_TIME
│   │   └── It should not deduct that batch (liability lapses in the view with no write)
│   ├── Given liabilityETH exceeds gross NAV
│   │   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerQueuedLiabilityExceedsNAV
│   └── It should return total NAV in ETH (18 decimals)
├── Given whitelisted supported ERC-20s
│   ├── Given a supported ERC-20 has a non-zero balance
│   │   └── It should add the balance's ETH value via Oracle.convert (decimals normalized via IERC20Metadata.decimals())
│   ├── Given a supported ERC-20 has a zero balance
│   │   └── It should skip the Oracle entirely (zero balances cost ~nothing and cannot freeze NAV)
│   ├── Given a supported ERC-20 with a non-zero balance has a stale or invalid feed
│   │   └── It should revert (fail-closed; recover via removeSupportedERC20 — ADMIN or SECURITY)
│   └── Given a stranded token is NOT whitelisted
│       └── It should exclude the balance from NAV
├── Given a registered strategy's navInETH reverts
│   └── It should revert (protocol frozen until strategy is fixed or force-removed via forceRemoveStrategy)
├── Given no strategies registered
│   └── It should return StrategyManager + Controller + AMM free balances in ETH (or zero if none have balance)
└── Given strategies with zero NAV
    └── It should return correct total (including StrategyManager + Controller + AMM free balances)

StrategyManager::strategyNAVInUSD(address _strategy)
├── Given strategy is registered
│   ├── It should call strategy.navInETH()
│   ├── It should convert ETH NAV to USD via oracle
│   └── It should return strategy NAV in USD (18 decimals)
└── Given strategy is not registered
    └── It should revert with StrategyManagerStrategyNotRegistered

StrategyManager::totalNAVInUSD()
├── Given strategies are registered
│   ├── It should call totalNAVInETH() to get ETH NAV
│   ├── It should convert ETH NAV to USD via oracle
│   └── It should return total NAV in USD (18 decimals)
├── Given a registered strategy's navInETH reverts
│   └── It should revert (via totalNAVInETH())
├── Given no strategies registered
│   └── It should return StrategyManager + Controller + AMM free balances converted to USD (or zero if none have balance)
└── Given strategies with zero NAV
    └── It should return correct total (including StrategyManager + Controller + AMM free balances converted to USD)

StrategyManager::isStrategyRegistered(address _strategy)
├── Given strategy is registered
│   └── It should return true
├── Given strategy is not registered
│   └── It should return false
└── Given strategy address is zero
    └── It should return false

StrategyManager::strategies()
├── Given no strategies registered
│   └── It should return empty array
├── Given strategies are registered
│   └── It should return array of strategy addresses (from EnumerableSet.values())
└── Given large number of strategies
    └── It should return all strategies efficiently (may have gas implications)

StrategyManager::strategyCount()
├── Given no strategies registered
│   └── It should return zero
├── Given strategies are registered
│   └── It should return count of strategies (from EnumerableSet.length())
└── Given strategies are added and removed
    └── It should return correct count

StrategyManager::registry()
└── It should return the protocol Registry address (set during initialization)

StrategyManager::Fuzz Testing
├── addStrategy() with random strategy addresses
│   ├── It should handle valid strategy addresses
│   └── It should revert on invalid strategy addresses
├── depositToStrategies() with random amounts
│   ├── It should handle valid amounts
│   └── It should respect maxDeposit limits
├── withdrawFromStrategies() with random amounts
│   ├── It should handle valid amounts
│   └── It should respect maxWithdrawal limits
└── totalNAVInUSD() with random strategy NAVs
    ├── It should calculate correctly
    └── It should include Controller balance

StrategyManager::Edge Cases
├── Adding strategy with zero NAV
│   └── It should succeed (strategy reports its own NAV)
├── Strategies reporting different NAV values
│   ├── It should read NAV correctly from each strategy
│   └── It should calculate total NAV correctly
├── Removing all strategies
│   ├── It should clear all mappings
│   ├── It should clear strategy set
│   └── It should return Controller balance in totalNAVInUSD()
├── Multiple rapid operations
│   ├── It should handle sequential operations
│   └── It should maintain consistency
├── Deposit with no healthy strategies
│   ├── It should return zero
│   └── It should return all ETH to controller
├── Withdrawal with no available liquidity
│   └── It should return zero
├── Deposit with empty registry
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerNoStrategiesRegistered
├── Withdrawal with empty registry
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerNoStrategiesRegistered
├── Invalid depositWeight (> MAX_DEPOSIT_WEIGHT)
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerInvalidDepositWeight
├── Invalid withdrawalWeight (> MAX_WITHDRAWAL_WEIGHT)
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerInvalidWithdrawalWeight
├── Pagination with invalid range
│   ├── It should revert when endIndex > strategies.length
│   └── It should revert when startIndex >= endIndex
└── Pagination with valid range
    ├── It should process only strategies in the specified range
    └── It should skip strategies outside the range

StrategyManager::Integration Scenarios
├── Complete strategy lifecycle
│   ├── Add strategy (strategy reports its own NAV)
│   ├── Deposit funds to strategy
│   ├── Withdraw funds from strategy
│   ├── Verify NAV is read from strategy
│   └── Remove strategy
├── Multiple strategies management
│   ├── Add multiple strategies
│   ├── Deposit funds proportionally
│   ├── Withdraw funds proportionally
│   ├── Verify individual and total NAVs (read from strategies)
│   └── Remove strategies selectively
├── Keeper workflow integration
│   ├── Controller receives ETH from AMM
│   ├── Controller deposits to strategies via StrategyManager
│   ├── Controller withdraws from strategies via StrategyManager
│   └── Controller rebalances strategies via StrategyManager
├── Role management integration
│   ├── ADMIN_ROLE on Registry gates addStrategy/removeStrategy/forceRemoveStrategy/pause/unpause/upgrade
│   ├── CONTROLLER identity verified via onlyValidContract(Auth.CONTROLLER)
│   └── Operational roles are not stored locally on StrategyManager
└── Upgrade scenarios
    ├── Contract upgrade with state preservation
    ├── Registry reference preserved in namespaced storage after upgrade
    └── Strategy data integrity after upgrade

StrategyManager::Upgrade Testing
├── Given caller has ADMIN_ROLE on Registry
│   ├── It should allow contract upgrades
│   └── It should maintain state after upgrade
├── Given caller does not have ADMIN_ROLE on Registry
│   └── It should revert with UUPSUnauthorizedCallContext
└── Given upgrade with invalid implementation
    └── It should revert with UUPSUnsupportedProxiableUUID

StrategyManager::Reentrancy Testing
├── Given reentrancy in addStrategy
│   └── It should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
├── Given reentrancy in removeStrategy
│   └── It should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
├── Given reentrancy in depositToStrategies
│   └── It should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
├── Given reentrancy in withdrawFromStrategies
│   └── It should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
└── Given reentrancy in checkAndRebalanceStrategies
    └── It should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall

StrategyManager::harvestPerformanceFeeFromStrategy(address _strategy)
├── Given caller is not the registered Controller
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientInvalidCaller
├── Given strategy is not registered
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerStrategyNotRegistered
├── Given contract is paused
│   └── It should revert with EnforcedPause
├── Given performanceFeeBps is zero
│   └── It should return (0, 0) without minting
├── Given strategy is paused
│   └── It should return (0, 0) without minting
├── Given no uncharged LP fees on the strategy
│   └── It should return (0, 0) without minting
├── Given uncharged LP fees round feeETH to zero
│   ├── It should return (0, 0) without minting
│   └── It should leave strategy charged counters unchanged (dust stays feeable)
├── Given valid accrued fee and MINTER_ROLE granted
│   ├── It should call strategy.settlePerformanceFee()
│   ├── It should mint EVE to daoTreasury
│   ├── It should return (eveAmount, feeETHEquivalent)
│   └── It should emit PerformanceFeePaid
├── Given strategy.settlePerformanceFee() reverts
│   └── It should revert (strict single-strategy path)
└── Given reentrancy attack
    └── It should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall

StrategyManager::harvestPerformanceFeeFromStrategies()
├── Given caller is not the registered Controller
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientInvalidCaller
├── Given multiple strategies with accrued fees
│   ├── It should settle each strategy via settlePerformanceFee()
│   ├── It should mint EVE once for the summed feeETH at the pre-batch supply/NAV
│   ├── It should return total (eveAmount, feeETHEquivalent)
│   ├── It should emit per-strategy PerformanceFeePaid with pro-rata EVE
│   └── It should emit StrategyHarvestFailed(strategy, reason) and continue when one settlePerformanceFee() reverts
└── Given contract is paused
    └── It should revert with EnforcedPause

StrategyManager::harvestPerformanceFeeFromStrategies(uint256 _startIndex, uint256 _endIndex)
├── Given caller is not the registered Controller
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientInvalidCaller
├── Given contract is paused
│   └── It should revert with EnforcedPause
├── Given invalid range
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerInvalidRange
├── Given multiple strategies with accrued fees in range
│   ├── It should settle each strategy in range via settlePerformanceFee()
│   ├── It should mint EVE once for the summed feeETH at the pre-batch supply/NAV
│   ├── It should return total (eveAmount, feeETHEquivalent)
│   ├── It should emit per-strategy PerformanceFeePaid with pro-rata EVE
│   ├── It should emit StrategyHarvestFailed(strategy, reason) and continue when one settlePerformanceFee() reverts
│   └── It should leave pending fees on strategies outside the range
└── Given reentrancy attack
    └── It should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall

StrategyManager::setPerformanceFeeBps(uint256 _feeBps)
├── Given caller does not have ADMIN_ROLE on Registry
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientMissingRole
├── Given _feeBps exceeds MAX_PERFORMANCE_FEE_BPS
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerInvalidPerformanceFeeBps
└── Given valid _feeBps
    ├── It should update performanceFeeBps (zero disables harvesting)
    └── It should emit PerformanceFeeBpsChanged (initial is the prior stored value)

StrategyManager::setDaoTreasury(address _treasury)
├── Given _treasury is zero address
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerZeroDaoTreasury
└── Given valid non-zero treasury
    ├── It should update daoTreasury
    └── It should emit DaoTreasuryChanged (initial is the prior stored value)

StrategyManager::setStrategyDepositCooldown(uint256 _cooldown)
├── Given caller does not have ADMIN_ROLE on Registry
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientMissingRole
├── Given _cooldown exceeds MAX_STRATEGY_DEPOSIT_COOLDOWN
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerInvalidStrategyDepositCooldown
├── Given _cooldown equals MAX_STRATEGY_DEPOSIT_COOLDOWN
│   └── It should update strategyDepositCooldown
└── Given valid _cooldown
    ├── It should update strategyDepositCooldown (zero disables the cooldown, default)
    └── It should emit StrategyDepositCooldownUpdated with old and new values

StrategyManager::isStrategyInDepositCooldown(address _strategy)
├── Given strategyDepositCooldown is zero (default)
│   └── It should return false
├── Given strategy has never been withdrawn from (lastStrategyWithdrawal == 0)
│   └── It should return false
├── Given less than strategyDepositCooldown seconds elapsed since lastStrategyWithdrawal
│   └── It should return true
└── Given at least strategyDepositCooldown seconds elapsed since lastStrategyWithdrawal
    └── It should return false

StrategyManager::pendingPerformanceFeeInETH(address _strategy)
├── Given strategy is not registered
│   └── It should revert with StrategyManagerStrategyNotRegistered
├── Given strategy is paused
│   └── It should return zero
├── Given strategy has uncharged LP fees and performanceFeeBps > 0
│   └── It should delegate to strategy.pendingPerformanceFeeInETH(performanceFeeBps)
└── Given no uncharged LP fees or performanceFeeBps is zero
    └── It should return zero

StrategyManager::Gas Optimization Testing
├── Given large number of strategies
│   ├── It should handle efficiently
│   └── It should not exceed gas limits
├── Given frequent deposit operations
│   ├── It should optimize gas usage
│   └── It should maintain performance
└── Given strategy set operations
    ├── It should handle set growth efficiently
    └── It should optimize removal operations
